# Coxeter words for the letters of the lower wires

Translation of `KData.agda`.  For each of the twelve letters on wires 0, 1,
2, a word of `S₈`'s Coxeter generators whose circuit (`PFrames.Pc`) has the
letter's function on the eight Gray positions of the lower states; any
other letter gets `ε`.  `KFaithful` checks each of them.

Generated by `gen/mk_kdata.py` (the port of the Agda's).  A word is
`FreeMonoid.ofList` of its letters (the Agda's `[ s₀ ]ʷ • [ s₂ ]ʷ • …`).
-/
import QCert.XCXCCX4bit.CLabels

namespace QCert.XCXCCX4bit.KData

open Placed (PG)
open PFrames (CW)
open CLabels (s₀ s₁ s₂ s₃ s₄ s₅ s₆)

def rg : PG → CW 8
  | .Xₚ 0 => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₀, s₂, s₄, s₆]
  | .Xₚ 1 => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₀, s₁, s₀, s₂, s₁, s₀, s₄, s₅, s₄, s₆, s₅, s₄]
  | .Xₚ 2 => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₀, s₁, s₀, s₂, s₁, s₀, s₃, s₂, s₁, s₀, s₄, s₃, s₂, s₁, s₀, s₅, s₄,
      s₃, s₂, s₁, s₀, s₆, s₅, s₄, s₃, s₂, s₁, s₀]
  | .CXₚ 0 1 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₁, s₅]
  | .CXₚ 0 2 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₁, s₂, s₁, s₃, s₂, s₄, s₃, s₂, s₁, s₅, s₄, s₃, s₂, s₁]
  | .CXₚ 1 0 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₂, s₄]
  | .CXₚ 1 2 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₂, s₃, s₂, s₄, s₃, s₂]
  | .CXₚ 2 0 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₄, s₆]
  | .CXₚ 2 1 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₄, s₅, s₄, s₆, s₅, s₄]
  | .CCXₚ 0 1 2 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₂, s₃, s₄, s₃, s₂]
  | .CCXₚ 0 2 1 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₅]
  | .CCXₚ 1 2 0 _ => FreeMonoid.ofList [s₄]
  | _ => 1

end QCert.XCXCCX4bit.KData
